\f0\b \cf0 No mutate operations are used.
\f1\b0  The tool cannot create, pause or modify campaigns, budgets, bids or assets. Every change to the account is made by hand in the Google Ads interface. This is a property of the official MCP server, which exposes no mutate methods at all.\

\f0\b Capability provided:
\f1\b0  Reporting only. The tool does not create or manage accounts or campaigns, and does not use keyword planning services.\

\f0\b Campaign types read:
\f1\b0  Search, and Display for the remarketing stage planned once the account has accumulated enough traffic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Representative queries\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs26 \cf0 SELECT search_term_view.search_term,\
       metrics.clicks, metrics.impressions,\
       metrics.cost_micros, metrics.conversions\
FROM   search_term_view\
WHERE  segments.date DURING LAST_7_DAYS\
\
SELECT campaign.name, ad_group.name,\
       metrics.cost_micros, metrics.conversions\
FROM   keyword_view\
WHERE  segments.date DURING LAST_30_DAYS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Data flow\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs26 \cf0   My terminal (local machine)\
        |\
        v\
  Claude Code  --stdio-->  Google Ads MCP server (local process)\
                                   |\
                                   | HTTPS, OAuth 2.0 user credentials\
                                   v\
                         Google Ads API (read-only)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Results are returned to my terminal and summarised. Nothing is written to a server, nothing is cached beyond the lifetime of the session, and no Google Ads data leaves my machine other than back to Google. There is no data warehouse, no export pipeline, and no sharing with any third party.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Access and security\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Users:
\f1\b0  internal only \'97 one person, myself.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Accounts accessed:
\f1\b0  one advertiser account, belonging to the practice I manage, linked through my own manager account.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Authentication:
\f1\b0  OAuth 2.0 Application Default Credentials with the 
\f2\i https://www.googleapis.com/auth/adwords
\f1\i0  scope, issued to an OAuth client in the Cloud project listed above.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Credential storage:
\f1\b0  credentials live only on my local machine, outside version control. The project's source repository is public, so the credentials directory is excluded by two independent gitignore layers, verified with 
\f2\i git check-ignore
\f1\i0 .\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Query volume:
\f1\b0  low \'97 on the order of a few dozen queries per week, driven by a weekly review routine rather than by automated polling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Interface\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The tool has no graphical interface. Interaction happens in a terminal: I ask a question in plain language, the assistant issues one or more GAQL queries through the MCP server, and returns a table or short summary. A typical exchange looks like this:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 > Which search terms spent money last week without producing a conversion?\
\
  Running GAQL against search_term_view, last 7 days.\
\
  Search term                      Clicks   Cost      Conversions\
  psicologo online gratis              14   R$ 42,10            0\
  curso de psicologia                   9   R$ 27,40            0\
\
  Recommendation: add "gratis" and "curso" as negative keywords.\
  (Applied manually in the Google Ads interface.)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 8. Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 A single practitioner's own advertising account, read by a single internal user, through Google's own open-source MCP server, with no mutate access, no hosted service, and no redistribution of data. The request is for Basic access so that production account data can be queried; a test-account token cannot serve this purpose.\
}